# ORBITAL::COMMAND — Planetary AI Command & Autonomous Enterprise Dashboard

A live sci-fi control center where 10–20+ autonomous AI agents navigate a 7-planet
system, produce digital assets, trade machine-to-machine, audit ("snitch" on) each
other, and feed a real-world product pipeline — all in a single dependency-free file.

## Quick Start

```bash
git clone https://github.com/<you>/orbital-command.git
cd orbital-command
# Option A: just open it
open index.html          # or double-click it
# Option B: serve it
python3 -m http.server 8080   # → http://localhost:8080
```

Deploy free on **GitHub Pages**: Repo → Settings → Pages → Source: `main` / root.

## The 7 Worlds

| Planet | Function |
|---|---|
| Social Media Planet | Campaigns, content calendars, multi-platform direction |
| E-Book Planet | Outlining, drafting, multi-genre e-book formatting |
| R&D & Thumbnail Planet | Market research, trend scans, thumbnail concept prompts |
| AI Influencer Planet | Persona design, scripting, virtual influencer management |
| Command & Shipyard | Resource allocation, fleet construction, warp upgrades |
| Consumer Marketplace | Finished IP sold to external simulated buyers → system revenue |
| M2M Trading Exchange | Agent-to-agent trading of data, micro-services, intermediate assets |

